8f4e/v1

note
; @config testRuntime.enabled true

Overloads distinguish pointers to
integers from pointers to floats.
noteEnd

function readState
#impure
param int* value
push *value
functionEnd int

function readState
#impure
param float* value
push *value
functionEnd float

entry test
module integerCaller
int value 7
call readState &value
assertEqual 7
moduleEnd

module floatCaller
float value 2.5
call readState &value
assertEqual 2.5
moduleEnd
entryEnd
